+---
+id: task-002-implement-rfc-6902-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Outcome
+
+Implemented and documented `applyPatch` in `src/index.ts`. It applies RFC 6902 `add`, `remove`,
+`replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations with strict RFC 6901 paths, and never mutates the
+input document.
+
+## Verification
+
+Added red-first tests for all operations, root operations, escaped paths, copy independence, invalid
+patches, failed operations, and source-document immutability. `npm test` passes.
